<title>FINLAND: Trade in TT Tieto suspended - bourse.</title>
<headline>Trade in TT Tieto suspended - bourse.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade in Finnish data systems group TT Tieto Oy was suspended on Thursday at 1130/0830 GMT, the Helsinki Stock Exchange said in a statement.</p>
<p>The share was untraded before the suspension, closing on Wednesday at 274.00 markka, just below a 275.00 year-high posted during Wednesday trade.</p>
<p>TT Tieto will hold a news conference at 1500/1200 GMT, a Tieto spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358 - 9 - 680 50 242</p>
